- **cron**: `hcron` is the one scheduler for every scheduled job on this Mac (harness, firstmate projects, my own tasks). Register jobs with `hcron add <id> --cron "7 * * * *" --cmd "..." [--cwd DIR] [--window 20:00-05:00] [--needs gui|unlocked] [--timeout 50m] [--catchup] [--project NAME]`, never with a new launchd plist. Jobs live in `__PROFILE_DIR__/cron/jobs.json`; `hcron status`, `hcron logs <id>`, `hcron pause all` is the kill switch. Failures and lock-skips go to Telegram (send-only). Status: `__HARNESS_DIR__/modules/cron/install.sh --status`.
